Subject: [PATCH] editor erosion: hillslope creep for the droplet solver
 (terrain veins: the ridge left standing between two grooves is never dug, the
 feedback rounds deepen the grooves with every run; after every round the
 change made so far is smoothed, scaled with density / rounds), tests
 (TestVeins, TestFlankShare), goldens

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F37er45a7etRuMgEW1q3kY

